@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:说、说我把<br>头发编进礼服<br>再利用礼服<br>对艾玛使用魔法……<br>根本没有<br>任何证据哇！|#0204Trial09_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Cry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而且，我根本<br>没有时间<br>做那种事！|#0204Trial09_Hanna002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我乘电梯<br>到上层之后，<br>雪莉<link=\"Objection_02_04_09_01\">马上</link>就来了！<br>我根本不可能做那些哇！|#0204Trial09_Hanna003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

