@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……或许<br>确实是这样。|#0204Trial09_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆心情補足・犯人でない可能性を探しつつ、茶化せなくなる

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"不过你看，<br>汉娜使用魔法的时候<br>不是每次都<br>一副<link=\"Objection_02_04_09_02\">很用力</link>的样子吗——|#0204Trial09_Sherry002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:在上层的时候，<br>可没有看到她做那样的动作哦～|#0204Trial09_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Open3,Mouth2_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……现在还无法确定<br>艾玛和蕾雅<br>被杀的准确时间。<br>|#0204Trial09_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

