@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果是在较久前的时间杀人，<br>并且做好了<br>让尸体飘浮的<br>事前准备，<br>那就可以瞬间做到。|#0204Trial09_Hiro002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Closed1,Mouth2_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而且，假如汉娜的<br>魔女化程度已经加剧，<br>那么她也有可能<br>像奈叶香那样，<br>魔法得到增强……|#0204Trial09_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR8,ArmL4,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:就算她能<br>比平时更自由地<br>操纵物体飘浮，<br>也不足为奇……！|#0204Trial09_Hiro004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:说那些<br>不过是强词夺理罢了！|#0204Trial09_Hanna004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我根本<br>没有时间<br>做什么事前准备……！<br>我不是凶手！<br>|#0204Trial09_Hanna005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Flushed_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我、我那时候<br>不是在地下吗！<br>对吧，各位！|#0204Trial09_Hanna006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……但、但是，<br>在调查地下仓库的时候，<br>我们也没有余暇<br>观察周围人<br>在做什么……|#0204Trial09_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:小娜是不是<br>一直都在地下……<br>老实说，大叔我也不知道。|#0204Trial09_Miria002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
